hnsbi-toolkit
=============

The statistical design and example implementations were developed alongside
the hybrid neural density-estimation project.

Portions of the flow, streaming-data, and ratio-integration design are adapted
from the MIT-licensed `nsbi-lhc-toolkit` project:

  Copyright (c) 2025-present Jay Sandesara
  https://github.com/rafaellopesdesa/nsbi-lhc-toolkit

The integration and archival notebook provenance for this release is pinned to
commit:

  e1249eb90e78b9fcbf24bf39cb9575fa3b621785

The five preserved notebooks and their required helper files originate from:

  workshops/ml4hep_tifr_colab/

The upstream nsbi-lhc-toolkit remains a runtime integration rather than being
vendored here. Its classifier training, calibration diagnostics, workspace
model, and JAX/Minuit inference interfaces are used where applicable.
